{"articleNo":"146529","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=146529&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"경북청년해외취업지원사업 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2016.02.25","hit":"2741","attachments":[{"name":"경북청년해외취업지원사업 안내문 및 신청서.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=146529&attachNo=75263"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; WORD-BREAK: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">[</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">경북청년해외취업지원사업 안내]</span></span></span></strong></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; WORD-BREAK: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><br><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;경북청년들의 해외취업 지원을 위해 경상북도가 주최하고 (재)경상북도경제진흥원이 주관하는 </span></p><p style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;경북청년해외취업지원사업을&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">실시하오니 학생들의 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">많은 참여바랍니다.</span></span></p><p style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; □ <strong>지원대상</strong> : <font color=\"#0055ff\">19세 ~ 34세 청년 120명</font></span><br><font color=\"#0055ff\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ­&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;경북 소재 대학 졸업예정자 및 졸업생</span><br><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ­&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;경북에 주소를 둔 청년</span></font></p><p style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><font color=\"#0055ff\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"></span></font>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><br><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; □ <strong>우선선발대상</strong></span><br><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 해외 취업 후 해외 창업 희망자</span></p><p style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\">&nbsp;<br><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; □ <strong>지원 내용</strong></span><br><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ○ 컨설팅 연수 및 출국지원</span><br><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 구인 기업 모집, 개별 컨설팅 및 개별 연수, 구인 기업 면접 컨설팅</span><br><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-&nbsp;취업 비자 발급 컨설팅, 항공료, 보험료, 현지정착비 등 지원</span><br><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 출국 지원 컨설팅, 사후관리</span></p><p style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><br><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;○ 해외 취업 성공시 보험료,항공료, 현지정착비 등 지원</span><br><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 아시아, 오세아니아 지역 : 1인당 2백만원 한도</span><br><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 미주, 유럽 지역 : 1인당 3백만원 한도</span></p><p style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><br><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; □ <strong>주최/주관</strong> : 경상북도/(재)경상북도경제진흥원</span></p><p style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><br><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; □ <strong>신청서 접수 기간</strong> : <font color=\"#0055ff\">상시 접수 (사업비 소진시 조기마감)</font></span></p><p style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font color=\"#0055ff\"></font></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0